lMacron/status/2091465979784024574","published_at":"2026-08-23T10:02:01.796Z","published_date":"2026-08-23","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Thom Gicquel et Delphine Delrue sont champions du monde de badminton en double mixte : une première pour la France ! Bravo à nos deux champions !","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":2801,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2091434824217043091","post_id":"2091434824217043091","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2091434824217043091","published_at":"2026-08-23T07:58:13.730Z","published_date":"2026-08-23","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Avec la disparition de Siim Kallas, l’Europe perd l’un de ses artisans les plus convaincus.\n       \nActeur majeur de l’ancrage européen de l’Estonie, de la création de sa monnaie après l’indépendance, à son adhésion à l’Union européenne puis à l’euro, il aura consacré son action à notre Europe réunifiée, comme Premier ministre de l’Estonie puis Vice-Président de la Commission européenne.\n\nJ’adresse mes sincères condoléances au peuple estonien, à sa fille @KajaKallas, ainsi qu’à toute sa famille.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":3365,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2091134503452344647","post_id":"2091134503452344647","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2091134503452344647","published_at":"2026-08-22T12:04:51.680Z","published_date":"2026-08-22","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Je me suis entretenu avec le Président @ZelenskyyUa au lendemain de la double frappe russe en plein jour contre un centre commercial à Kryvyi Rih, qui a fait de très nombreuses victimes civiles. Je lui ai dit notre horreur et notre émotion.\n                     \nAvec ces frappes et celles cette semaine contre Kyiv, la Russie poursuit et aggrave le crime de son agression. En visant systématiquement des civils, et en faisant le choix de l'intimidation et de l'escalade, la Russie cherche probablement à projeter la force mais signe surtout un aveu de faiblesse. \n\nIl est crucial, dans ce contexte, de donner à l'Ukraine tous les moyens nécessaires pour défendre son ciel et faire échec à cette agression. J'ai annoncé au Président Zelensky le renforcement de notre soutien, avec l'envoi d'intercep…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":10579,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2090051815614099732","post_id":"2090051815614099732","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2090051815614099732","published_at":"2026-08-19T12:22:38.784Z","published_date":"2026-08-19","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"François Patriat s'est éteint. \n\nLa Côte d'Or et la Bourgogne perdent l'un de leurs plus fidèles serviteurs. La République, l'un de ses plus infatigables artisans. Pour ma part, je perds un ami cher.\n                 \nÀ sa famille, à ses proches, à ceux qui comme moi l'aimaient, j'adresse mes condoléances les plus émues.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":3128,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2089786411570389143","post_id":"2089786411570389143","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2089786411570389143","published_at":"2026-08-18T18:48:01.529Z","published_date":"2026-08-18","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Femme de conviction et de conquête, militante, Yvette Roudy fit de l’égalité entre les femmes et les hommes un droit effectif et une exigence de la République. \n       \nElle contribua à faire du 8 mars la Journée internationale des droits des femmes en France, fit inscrire l’IVG à la Sécurité sociale et porta la loi du 13 juillet 1983 pour l’égalité professionnelle. \n\nSes conquêtes demeurent.\n\nÀ nous tous de porter plus loin son combat pour l’égalité.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1452,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2089703442302337533","post_id":"2089703442302337533","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2089703442302337533","published_at":"2026-08-18T13:18:20.114Z","published_date":"2026-08-18","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"L’heure des pionnières. En d