rit de résistance qui a tenu la France et garanti notre indépendance vive.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":5204,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2088537401660518460","post_id":"2088537401660518460","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2088537401660518460","published_at":"2026-08-15T08:04:54.361Z","published_date":"2026-08-15","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Congratulations to the Indian people on your 80th Independence Day! 🇮🇳🇫🇷","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":49746,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2086872211646714297","post_id":"2086872211646714297","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2086872211646714297","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:48:02.124Z","published_date":"2026-08-10","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Face au terrible séisme qui a frappé la Colombie, j’adresse, au nom de la France, mes pensées les plus sincères au peuple colombien.\n                       \nJe pense aux victimes, à leurs familles, aux blessés et à toutes celles et ceux qui ont été touchés par cette catastrophe. Notre solidarité va également aux équipes de secours et à tous ceux qui œuvrent, avec courage, pour venir en aide aux populations sinistrées.\n\nDans cette épreuve, la Colombie peut compter sur notre amitié et notre soutien.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":13749,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2086531969731416299","post_id":"2086531969731416299","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2086531969731416299","published_at":"2026-08-09T19:16:02.130Z","published_date":"2026-08-09","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Félicitations à Demi Vollering, vainqueure du Tour de France Femmes ! \n\nÀ chaque étape, un même engouement et une ferveur populaire pour faire vivre cette grande fête du cyclisme mondial. Une course qui rassemble, une fierté française.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":2118,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2084965297480482824","post_id":"2084965297480482824","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2084965297480482824","published_at":"2026-08-05T11:30:38.358Z","published_date":"2026-08-05","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"À Kyiv et dans sa région, la Russie a une nouvelle fois choisi de cibler des civils. Cette politique de terreur, menée à coups de missiles et de drones, est inacceptable.\n              \nChaque nouvelle attaque renforce une évidence : la Russie doit payer le prix de son agression et répondre de ses crimes. Aux côtés de l’Ukraine, nous ne céderons ni à la lassitude ni à l’intimidation.\n\nL’Union européenne et ses partenaires continueront d’accroître la pression sur la Russie, notamment par de nouvelles sanctions, tout en renforçant le soutien militaire à l’Ukraine afin qu’elle puisse se défendre et protéger sa population.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":10924,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"38ad7cc63c973478ff212478eca5fbb26edd8e9cc3188a04627b870a0255e2c7","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__3MLAAIAAAATMjA5MTY1Mzg5MDU5NjkxMzM2MAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false}]